  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ZIRF Counselling 2023 - Country Fact Sheets (CFS)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The International Organization for Migration (IOM) has been implementing the ZIRF Counselling - Country Fact Sheet (CFS) project since 2006. The project contributes to support migrants in making an informed decision on voluntary return and raise awareness on reintegration assistance available. To this end, the project strengthens the German Assisted Voluntary Return and Reintegration (AVRR) counselling network. It also enables the provision of up-to-date information regarding the situation in 16 selected countries of origin.</narrative>
  </description>
